{"seq":2,"slug":"baking-science","title":"烘焙原理","stage":"DONE","category":"cooking-food-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 烘焙原理：从面粉到成品的科学解构\n\n烘焙是一门精确的应用科学。与烹饪中\"适量\"\"少许\"的模糊表达不同，烘焙要求配方精度达到克级，温度控制精确到度，时间误差不超过分钟。这种精确性源于其底层——面筋网络形成、发酵产气、油脂乳化、淀粉糊化、蛋白质变性——每一个物理化学过程都有明确的阈值和动力学规律。\n\n本 hub 从四个核心维度解构烘焙科学：\n\n**面粉与面筋**是烘焙的结构基础。小麦面粉中的麦谷蛋白（glutenin）和醇溶蛋白（gliadin）在水合后通过二硫键交联形成三维网络，决定了面团的弹性与延展性。不同蛋白质含量的面粉适用于不同产品——从高筋面包粉的强韧网络到低筋蛋糕粉的酥松质地。\n\n**膨胀与发酵**赋予烘焙产品体积和组织结构。生物膨胀（酵母发酵）、化学膨胀（泡打粉/小苏打）和物理膨胀（蒸汽/空气）三种机制各有其适用场景和控制参数。酵母的酒精发酵不仅产气，还通过代谢副产物赋予面包独特风味。\n\n**油脂与糖**在烘焙中扮演多重功能角色。油脂通过\"缩短\"面筋网络赋予产品酥性，同时影响口感、保鲜和风味载体功能。糖不仅提供甜味，还参与美拉德反应着色、调控水分活度、影响面筋形成和控制结晶行为。\n\n**热传递与烘焙**是将生面团转化为成品的关键步骤。烤箱中同时发生对流、辐射和传导三种传热方式，驱动淀粉糊化、蛋白质变性、水分蒸发和表面褐变等一系列不可逆转化。理解这些热力学过程，才能精确控制产品的组织结构和外观品质。\n\n掌握这些原理，面包师能从\"按配方操作\"进阶到\"理解为何这样操作\"——当遇到问题时，能从机理层面诊断原因并设计解决方案。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flour-gluten","title":"面粉与面筋科学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/flour-gluten","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flour-composition","title":"小麦面粉组成与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/flour-gluten/flour-composition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gluten-network","title":"面筋网络形成机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/flour-gluten/gluten-network"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dough-rheology","title":"面团流变学与水合控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/flour-gluten/dough-rheology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"leavening-fermentation","title":"膨胀与发酵","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/leavening-fermentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"yeast-biochemistry","title":"酵母发酵的生物化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/leavening-fermentation/yeast-biochemistry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chemical-leavening","title":"化学膨胀剂原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/leavening-fermentation/chemical-leavening"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fermentation-process","title":"发酵工艺与面包风味","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/leavening-fermentation/fermentation-process"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"fats-sugar-roles","title":"油脂与糖的功能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/fats-sugar-roles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fat-functionality","title":"油脂功能学：起酥、乳化与口感工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/fats-sugar-roles/fat-functionality"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sugar-crystallization","title":"糖的结晶与非晶态：焦糖化与玻璃态转变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/fats-sugar-roles/sugar-crystallization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"butter-margarine-oils","title":"黄油、人造黄油与植物油对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/fats-sugar-roles/butter-margarine-oils"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"heat-transfer-baking","title":"烘焙热传递","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/heat-transfer-baking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conduction-convection-radiation","title":"传导、对流与辐射传热","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/heat-transfer-baking/conduction-convection-radiation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"oven-dynamics","title":"烤箱动力学：温度场与湿度控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/heat-transfer-baking/oven-dynamics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crust-crumb-formation","title":"外壳与瓤体形成机理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/heat-transfer-baking/crust-crumb-formation"}]}]}